The power of the mind to directly influence the world is a rare and
mysterious gift. Those who possess psionic abilities are born with them,
a latent potential that lies dormant until awakened by proper training.
No amount of study can grant these powers to one who was not born with
the gift - psionics is not learned, it is unlocked.

Any class of adventurer may possess psionic potential, from the mightiest
warrior to the wisest mage. The gift does not discriminate by profession.
However, those who wish to develop their abilities must seek out a teacher,
for the path to unlocking one's mental potential is fraught with danger
for those who attempt it alone.

Psionic practitioners are few and secretive, their abilities often
mistaken for magic or divine intervention by the uninitiated. They
communicate through thought, perceive what others cannot, and bend
reality with the force of their will. Their powers consume mana, drawn
from the same wellspring of mental energy that fuels arcane magic.

Those born with the gift who wish to develop it must declare their
intention at the time of their creation, committing to the arduous
path of mental discipline that awaits.

